(92, 18, 'cainedaniel92@gmail.com', 'assistant', 'I understand your frustration with the late weekly report. It can be really disruptive when things don’t go as expected.\n\nTo address this, consider these steps:\n\n1. **Follow Up**: Reach out to the person responsible for the report. A brief check-in can clarify any issues they\'re facing.\n   \n2. **Set a New Deadline**: If possible, propose a new timeline for when you expect the report to be completed.\n\n3. **Evaluate Process**: After receiving the report, it might be useful to discuss how to prevent future delays.\n\nIf you need help drafting a message or have other concerns about this situation, just let me know!', 'neutral', 0, 0.35, 'CognitiveOS Default', '2026-03-28 07:37:10', NULL),
