(94, 18, 'cainedaniel92@gmail.com', 'assistant', 'No problem; it’s understandable to feel that way sometimes. Let’s focus on getting that report finished tonight. \n\nHere’s a quick plan to tackle it:\n\n1. **Outline Key Points**: List the main sections you need to cover. This will keep you organized.\n   \n2. **Set Time Blocks**: Break your work into manageable chunks. For example, dedicate 30 minutes to each section.\n\n3. **Minimize Distractions**: Find a quiet space and limit notifications to stay focused.\n\n4. **Review and Edit**: After drafting, take a few minutes to review and polish it.\n\nIf you’d like help with any specific section or need more details, just let me know!', 'neutral', 0, 0.35, 'CognitiveOS Default', '2026-03-28 07:37:21', NULL),
(95, 18, 'cainedaniel92@gmail.com', 'user', 'What did I tell you about my deadline preferences last time?', 'neutral', 0, 0.35, NULL, '2026-03-28 07:37:23', NULL),
(96, 18, 'cainedaniel92@gmail.com', 'assistant', 'You haven\'t mentioned any specific deadline preferences in our recent conversations. If you have particular deadlines in mind or any details you\'d like to clarify, feel free to share! I\'m here to help you manage your time effectively.', 'neutral', 0, 0.35, 'CognitiveOS Default', '2026-03-28 07:37:28', NULL),
(97, 18, 'cainedaniel92@gmail.com', 'user', 'Keep the same vibe but summarize next steps.', 'neutral', 0, 0.35, NULL, '2026-03-28 07:37:29', NULL),
(98, 18, 'cainedaniel92@gmail.com', 'assistant', 'Sure! Here’s a summary of the next steps to finish your report tonight:\n\n1. **Outline Key Points**: Create a list of the main sections you need to cover.\n   \n2. **Set Time Blocks**: Work in focused increments, like 30 minutes per section.\n\n3. **Minimize Distractions**: Find a quiet space and limit interruptions.\n\n4. **Review and Edit**: Allocate time at the end to polish your draft.\n\nIf you need assistance with any specific part of the report or have questions, let me know!', 'neutral', 0, 0.35, 'CognitiveOS Default', '2026-03-28 07:37:37', NULL);

